{3}].$" 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426787 1072 #uuid "97f24d3e-df80-5494-a01f-c5ae043371c6" 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426787 1074 "If $X$ is a discrete random variable with probability mass function $f(x)$ and sample space $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{3}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{3}]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{3}\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each squared value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{3}] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{3}\\cdot f(x) \\\\  & ={0}^{3}\\cdot 0.05+{1}^{3}\\cdot 0.4+{2}^{3}\\cdot 0.1+{3}^{3}\\cdot 0.2+{4}^{3}\\cdot 0.25 \\\\  & =0\\cdot 0.05+1\\cdot 0.4+8\\cdot 0.1+27\\cdot 0.2+64\\cdot 0.25 \\\\  & =0+0.4+0.8+5.4+16 \\\\  & =22.6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426788 1058 #edb/ref 17592186426791 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426788 1062 #uuid "18de0dd1-618a-5e31-817b-0e756daf3147" 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426788 1063 #edb/ref 17592186426786 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426789 1058 #edb/ref 17592186426790 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426789 1062 #uuid "d79ed21b-cce2-5cca-a6b9-df978d6fbdd6" 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426789 1063 #edb/ref 17592186426784 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426790 1058 #edb/ref 17592186426788 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426790 1062 #uuid "db3c4ac3-b4ba-5487-98a4-80e057758e86" 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426790 1063 #edb/ref 17592186426785 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426791 1058 #edb/ref 17592186426792 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426791 1062 #uuid "edc7c2d4-1f4f-5fa0-a157-630df08222ef" 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426791 1063 #edb/ref 17592186176376 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426792 1062 #uuid "febf35a0-8420-578a-9890-44f3cfbcd235" 13194139534589 17592186045417 true] [17592186426792 10